ment consiste en une couche continue directement liée à la base, d'une épaisseur de moins de 3  mu m, d'un fluoropolymère présentant des groupes fonctionnels hydrophiles et un point de fusion des cristaux de 200  DEG C ou plus.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>